OL,3,GNEWSASchool orchestra cuts penalise
OL,4,Ayoung people in rural areas, says
OL,5,Aprincipal
OL,6,
OL,7,FYoung people in rural areas are are
OL,8,Fbeing "penalised" following funding
OL,9,Fcuts to music in schools in Northern
OL,10,FIreland, a principal has said.
OL,12,FMore than 2,000 promising school
OL,13,Fmusicians have been told that transport
OL,14,Fto take part in bands and orchestras is
OL,15,Fbeing withdrawn as part of cuts to the
OL,16,FEducation Authority Youth Music
OL,17,FService.
OL,19,FThe Education Authority (EA) is aiming
OL,20,Fto make millions of pounds of savings
OL,21,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
