OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool orchestra cuts penalise
OL,4,Ayoung people in rural areas, says
OL,5,Aprincipal
OL,6,
OL,7,FLouise Aitcheson, principal of Dalriada
OL,8,FSchool in Ballymoney, County Antrim,
OL,9,Fwhose pupils travel to the senior
OL,10,Forchestra in Ballymena, said some young
OL,11,Fpeople will not be able to continue
OL,12,Fwith music as a result of the cuts.
